config TAPAS_ICC_HOLD
	tristate "Bandwidth vote for the bootloader's display scanout"
	depends on INTERCONNECT && OF
	help
	  Holds a DDR bandwidth vote, from the device tree, for the display
	  the bootloader left scanning out (simpledrm), which no kernel driver
	  votes for while the MDSS driver is off. Without it the scanout can
	  underrun when DDR clocks down.
